					<description><![CDATA[Philite® glass fiber filters are world-renowned as a standard for laboratory filtration and are associated with quality, reliability and reproducibility. These depth filters combine fast flow rates with high loading capacity, retention of very fine particles, and can be used at temperatures up to 500ºC. Our glass microfiber filters are mainly used in applications such as air or water monitoring and can be used as pre-filters for membranes.]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Waterfiltech offers glass microfiber filters manufactured from 100% borosilicate glass, with or without binder. Filters without binder are chemically inert.</p>
